# Handheld and controller layer, all from the configured CachyOS/Arch repositories.
# hhd (Handheld Daemon, Bazzite/ChimeraOS ecosystem) and InputPlumber (ShadowBlip, used by
# ChimeraOS) both ship their own udev rules, hwdb and systemd units; they are not
# re-implemented here. They compete for the same input devices: the image enables
# inputplumber.service and leaves hhd@ disabled (a unit drop-in makes them conflict).
# FRZR (ChimeraOS atomic updater) is intentionally not installed.
hhd
inputplumber
steamos-manager
power-profiles-daemon
iio-sensor-proxy
cachyos-settings
scx-scheds
scx-tools
